 <h3><u>Shaam-e-ghariba</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><b><u><font size=4></font></u></b></p>
  <p><b><u><font size=4>Shaam-e-ghariba</font></u></b></p>
  <b><u><font size=4> </font></u></b>
  <p><font size=4>Sog me dubi duniya thi saari</font></p>
  <font size=4> <p>Aayi Ali ki ban me sawaari </p> <p>(Pehre pe Zainab dard ki maari) x2</p> <p>Baap ko dekha roke pukaari</p> <p>Dekho to baba, haay, dekho to baba</p> <p>(Shaam-e-ghariba ka ye manzar) x2</p> 
   <ol>
    <li>Kehti thi rokar zainab-e-muztar</li>
    <p>Shaam-e-ghariba ka ye manzar, Kehti thi rokar zainab-e-muztar, Shaam-e-ghariba ka ye manzar</p>
    <li>(Deti thi Zainab ban me duhaayi, Haaye mujhe kyu mawt na aayi) x2 </li>
    <p>Khencha gaya beemaar ka bistar</p>
    <p>Shaam-e-ghariba ka ye manzar (Kehti thi rokar zainab-e-muztar, Shaam-e-ghariba ka ye manzar) x2</p>
    <li>(Teero(n) ne chayda baap ka sina, soye kaha par bali Sakina) x2</li>
    <p>Nawha kuna hai wo jalti zamee(n) par</p>
    <p>Shaam-e-ghariba ka ye manzar (Kehti thi rokar zainab-e-muztar, Shaam-e-ghariba ka ye manzar) x2</p>
    <li>(Sukhe huwe kuzo(n) ki sada hai, pyaase idhar hai udhar darya hai) x2</li>
    <p>Nawha yahi hai khushk labo(n) par</p>
    <p>Shaam-e-ghariba ka ye manzar (Kehti thi rokar zainab-e-muztar, Shaam-e-ghariba ka ye manzar) x2</p>
    <li>(Dasht-e-bala mei bikhre hai laashe, tute huwe talwaar aur neza) x2</li>
    <p>Dekho zara ay fatah-e-khaybar</p>
    <p>Shaam-e-ghariba ka ye manzar (Kehti thi rokar zainab-e-muztar, Shaam-e-ghariba ka ye manzar) x2</p>
    <li>(Kaisi luti haay aal-e-payambar, legaye zalim cheen ke chadar) x2</li>
    <p>Chaand sitare roye ye kehkar</p>
    <p>Shaam-e-ghariba ka ye manzar (Kehti thi rokar zainab-e-muztar, Shaam-e-ghariba ka ye manzar) x2</p>
    <li>(Door huwe jab god ke paale, rut gaye is ghar se ujale) x2</li>
    <p>Rone lagi hai dekh ke madar</p>
    <p>Shaam-e-ghariba ka ye manzar (Kehti thi rokar zainab-e-muztar, Shaam-e-ghariba ka ye manzar) x2</p>
    <li>(Khaak mere baalo(n) mei pari hai, khaak basar awlad-e-nabi hai) x2</li>
    <p>Sare kahani kehta hai rokar</p>
    <p>Shaam-e-ghariba ka ye manzar (Kehti thi rokar zainab-e-muztar, Shaam-e-ghariba ka ye manzar) x2</p>
    <li>(Baba inhe tawfeeq ye dena, hashr talak parhte rahe nawha) x2</li>
   </ol> <p>Yaad rahe Irfan aur Mazhar</p> <p>Shaam-e-ghariba ka ye manzar (Kehti thi rokar zainab-e-muztar, Shaam-e-ghariba ka ye manzar) x2</p></font>
